        "998"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:102607536f118caca8b3e09e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛前有一定会做的例行公事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d979824f772e97a57ea17e4d58d77a71626c7fd9d74b702d60a3ae4b45b24e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "999"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33a06018d574fbb532015d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在成为日本第一的赛马娘之前，绝对\\n不会停下脚步！我会努力加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ccbd1dea502a366daa1a608edc3e9adfe1308ff184b4b129f69e15f8ff3b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19bacda2102bb7046a97d5bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放学后要尽情享受的这件事吧！\\n我星期五晚上会好好狂欢提振精神喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f5262ef4298f22770a18d33ff8e2ff1be5f1029fc6d6831a2e28c1fff9ce39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e45b9c315c6d93e4cd0719",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会跑出令大家着迷的竞赛。\\n拜托大家给我连太阳公公都听得见的声援啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5855b820e9bf42bea01685ad5725b91f60b881579e7d040099c3b948f5ef857",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2331dd2359557c5df83f1ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至少也要拿下胜利。除此之外我完全不考虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a34cdc89068052872cdf3ef00d05acc4fae92b45fe7860b87e56f81ca31423b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01f14ff56d442ca6082e3f3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说我是坐在父亲腿上接受采访的。\\n立场观点的变化令我感触良深。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42f6676a80bcf1e8e3e6dede942a620c82bedafbc25253eac22d0343224fe01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:220b7bdc13367bcb19151215",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始前我一定会重新绑好头发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab89cd3ef16c5b92223ad5859c31ecbe23f5eae3e860f4a40b7c706b95a7c2a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61afe70bb5099246b216a7ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不。因为他们都非常地忙碌。\\n比赛结束后，我一定会……回报胜利的消息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "150051285927dc4d737b3fce1d5486aa688b0fad0d38ad47cc0927a838f0d17a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b831b97017af4ea9dd07eb95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会跑出不负家族之名的至高成绩。\\n敬请各位务必观赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3af9fd748195ad4c058dcfac46953aeb719575b5f771cfb3901f86cdab5b4b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4aea9e91a4bee16e29b819",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不。因为他们都非常地忙碌。\\n比赛结束后，我一定会……回报胜利的消息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "150051285927dc4d737b3fce1d5486aa688b0fad0d38ad47cc0927a838f0d17a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
